d left within her"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l011","ordinal":297130,"en":"A child of four months."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l012","ordinal":297131,"en":"She meant to depart in her grief,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l013","ordinal":297132,"en":"Yet remained alive and did not go;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l014","ordinal":297133,"en":"Semetey had left within her"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l015","ordinal":297134,"en":"A child three months in the craving."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l016","ordinal":297135,"en":"She meant to die from shame,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l017","ordinal":297136,"en":"Yet your sister-in-law remained alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l018","ordinal":297137,"en":"Because the ill-fated one in her womb"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l019","ordinal":297138,"en":"Was a token left by her beloved."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l020","ordinal":297139,"en":"Parted from her hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l021","ordinal":297140,"en":"The wretched, distraught Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l022","ordinal":297141,"en":"Lamented and burned with grief."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l023","ordinal":297142,"en":"Saying, “A token of the hero remains,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l024","ordinal":297143,"en":"This tormented, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l025","ordinal":297144,"en":"Made the three-month child in her womb"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l026","ordinal":297145,"en":"Her hope and consolation."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l027","ordinal":297146,"en":"Sobbing and crying aloud,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l028","ordinal":297147,"en":"She meant to die from shame,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l029","ordinal":297148,"en":"Yet remained alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l030","ordinal":297149,"en":"Because hope lay within her womb."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b005:l031","ordinal":297150,"en":"“My bloodthirsty lord is dead,” she said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l001","ordinal":297151,"en":"She had known before the true resting place"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l002","ordinal":297152,"en":"From which there is no return,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l003","ordinal":297153,"en":"Wailing and crying aloud,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l004","ordinal":297154,"en":"Sobbing that she would die with him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l005","ordinal":297155,"en":"And lie beside him by the river,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l006","ordinal":297156,"en":"There was no hope left by the hero."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l007","ordinal":297157,"en":"There was no heir left by the dear one,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l008","ordinal":297158,"en":"No token left by the gray wolf,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l009","ordinal":297159,"en":"Such is this wretched, shadowy world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l010","ordinal":297160,"en":"Thinking he would rest in a rivered land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l011","ordinal":297161,"en":"There was neither shade nor shelter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l012","ordinal":297162,"en":"No distant sign remained behind."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l013","ordinal":297163,"en":"Thinking all would be as a fire gone out,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l014","ordinal":297164,"en":"Let mighty Kyyaz take"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l015","ordinal":297165,"en":"This head as his spoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l016","ordinal":297166,"en":"She of silver eyes and sun-bright face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l017","ordinal":297167,"en":"The pillar of heroes among the brave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l018","ordinal":297168,"en":"The leader of the people among champions,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l019","ordinal":297169,"en":"Wished that he might leave descendants behind."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l020","ordinal":297170,"en":"Letting the goose be devoured by birds of prey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l021","ordinal":297171,"en":"Because of a single camel calf"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l022","ordinal":297172,"en":"She let herself be called a captive wife;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l023","ordinal":297173,"en":"For this she had come as spoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l024","ordinal":297174,"en":"Making the Kalmyk’s head a mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l025","ordinal":297175,"en":"And raising a woman’s head as a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l026","ordinal":297176,"en":"She had given her heart to Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l027","ordinal":297177,"en":"The dear woman Aichürök,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l028","ordinal":297178,"en":"When twilight fell and the sun went down,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l029","ordinal":297179,"en":"When all the people lay fast asleep,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l030","ordinal":297180,"en":"Would spread out the hair upon her back;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0025:b004:l031","ordinal":297181,"en":"Into brave Kyyaz’s embrace—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l001","ordinal":297182,"en":"Were her attendants,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l002","ordinal":297183,"en":"Sixty young wives and eighty maidens;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l003","ordinal":297184,"en":"Disguising them as herself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l004","ordinal":297185,"en":"She sent one each day"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l005","ordinal":297186,"en":"Into Khan Kyyaz’s embrace."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l006","ordinal":297187,"en":"Keeping her chaste self pure,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l007","ordinal":297188,"en":"Preserving herself untouched by anything,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l008","ordinal":297189,"en":"Dear Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l009","ordinal":297190,"en":"Protected herself in this way."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l010","ordinal":297191,"en":"The unfortunate woman possessed sacred powers"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l011","ordinal":297192,"en":"And many miracles;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l012","ordinal":297193,"en":"Among women in flowing gowns,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l013","ordinal":297194,"en":"She was a soul who surpassed them all."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l014","ordinal":297195,"en":"The tormented, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l015","ordinal":297196,"en":"Had a seal upon her tongue."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l016","ordinal":297197,"en":"She could sweep along at a horse’s speed"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l017","ordinal":297198,"en":"And fly throughout"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l018","ordinal":297199,"en":"The whole wide world;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l019","ordinal":297200,"en":"Such was the magic she possessed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l020","ordinal":297201,"en":"Only Friday knew of her flight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l021","ordinal":297202,"en":"Only the sacred night knew of her travels;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l022","ordinal":297203,"en":"When she transformed and flew,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l023","ordinal":297204,"en":"Who could know of that single flight?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l024","ordinal":297205,"en":"She made the open plains her wondrous summer pasture,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l025","ordinal":297206,"en":"Chanting incantations like a sorcerer"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l026","ordinal":297207,"en":"And casting blindness over human eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l027","ordinal":297208,"en":"Of all the wisdom granted humankind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l028","ordinal":297209,"en":"Not a hair’s breadth was lacking in her."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l029","ordinal":297210,"en":"Her curse was dreadful, her venom strong;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l030","ordinal":297211,"en":"Whomever she cursed, she laid low."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l031","ordinal":297212,"en":"Those who saw her majesty trembled;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l032","ordinal":297213,"en":"She knew with perfect mastery"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l033","ordinal":297214,"en":"The magic that blinded eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l034","ordinal":297215,"en":"When she transformed into a white swan,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0026:b003:l035","ordinal":297216,"en":"Only the darkening night knew of her flight;"}]
